D13. Church people are pretty dogmatic about this. ~ TENET
D14. What copy-cats usually take at speakeasies. ~ SAME
D17. The last resort of discontented wives. ~ RENO
D23. A well-known call word. ~ HEY
D25. Any genus of plants having flowers without petals but with petaloid sepals. (Better try another one.) ~ ANEMONE
